Data
----
This repository does not contain any molecular dynamics data, extracted latents, or trained model
weights. The pipeline is designed to be run on the ATLAS database of protein molecular dynamics
simulations:

  Vander Meersche Y, Cretin G, Gheeraert A, Gelly J-C, Galochkina T.
  ATLAS: protein flexibility description from atomistic molecular dynamics simulations.
  Nucleic Acids Research 52(D1):D384-D392 (2024).
  https://www.dsimb.inserm.fr/ATLAS

ATLAS is released under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license
(CC BY-NC 4.0). That restriction applies to the data and to material derived from it, such as
latents extracted from ATLAS trajectories, and it is not lifted by the license on this code.
Anyone who runs this pipeline on ATLAS must comply with those terms, including the restriction
to non-commercial use.
